            "review_text": "nedhop\nStockton, California240 contributions\n0\nA favorite meal, well done\nOct 2015 • Couples\nWe asked a desk clerk at our hotel, the Continental Saigon, to name the best Japanese restaurant in the city. He gave us Hanayuki (which is rated only #18 of the 151 in HCMC).\nWe were not disappointed. We ordered our favorite dish, shabu-shabu. The beef was prime, well sliced, and plentiful; he vegetables were fresh; the tofu and noodles tasty.\nUnusually, the waitress stayed with us virtually the whole meal, so that we had no chance to shabu-shabu anything ourselves.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 24, 2015",
