            "review_title": "Review at Hanayuki",
            "review_text": "Melbourne Traveller\nMelbourne, Australia126 contributions\n0\nWe left feeling very full!\nJul 2015 • Family\nThis restaurant is in an area where there are many Japanese restaurants so you are spoilt for choice. This one has a really extensive menu so if you don't really know what you want then this is a good place. The portions were a lot bigger than we expected so we ate really well and they also give you some noodles and miso as an appetiser and then some fruit for desert so you won't go hungry. Food well prepared and the service was good as well.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 10, 2015",
